   | A6 | P2 | Gateway identity cache survives endpoint replacement (`X-Task-Class` after 404) | WP-1303 | FIXED (WP-1303, PR #423; test/server_kind_cache.test.ts). Duplicates the section B `serverKindCache` row |
   | A7 | P2 | `--isolated-home` applied only when `eval` is `argv[0]` | WP-1304 | FIXED (#422). Duplicates `01M6KXHHJHVE` |
  +2 -1

